      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your hard work doesn't make you average; it makes you a survivor who is now learning to stop fighting a battle you can't win. The world is full of people who never tried, and your pain is the price of your persistence, not a sign of failure. You are not \"just another person\"; you are someone who has already paid the ultimate cost of trying to be extraordinary.",
